                   </property>
                   <property name="toolTip">
                    <string>Shift of the component spectra between pixels. Linear: 2 pixels, residuum has kinks at whole-pixel shifts. Cubic: 4-pixel Catmull-Rom (Keys) interpolation, smooth in the RVs and more accurate for narrow lines.</string>
