                   </property>
                  </widget>
                 </item>
                 <item row="2" column="1">
                  <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="doubleSpinBox_tdamp">
                   <property name="toolTip">
                    <string>LSQR with static lines: damping of the static spectrum, relative to the squared norm of each of its columns (0: off). The broad structure of the static spectrum is nearly undetermined (only the relative motion of the stars separates it from A and B): without damping LSQR needs many more iterations (iota Tri A, 47 x 70 000 pixels: 11 720 instead of 3 870) and A, B and the static spectrum take up large broad deviations of opposite sign. The lines of the static spectrum become smaller by this fraction.</string>
                   </property>
                   <property name="decimals">
                    <number>6</number>
                   </property>
